    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An Appealing 3 Bed Residence Enjoying Sweeping Sea Views \n\n26 Summit Place is set within this mature and established residential development and occupies an elevated position, offering far-reaching views towards Hook Lighthouse and the County Waterford coastline. The well-appointed living accommodation extends to approximately 82 sq m, offering comfortable and versatile living space comprising a living room with solid fuel stove, dining room, kitchen, three bedrooms and a bathroom. Outside, there are gardens to the front and rear together with a garden shed. There is also the benefit of rear access, providing valuable and practical dual access. Summit Place is only a short stroll from the village centre and its renowned Blue Flag sandy beach, as well as local pubs and restaurants. The wider Hook Peninsula, with its many beaches, coastal walks and attractions, is also within easy reach. Early viewing is highly recommended.\n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance Porch 3.4m x 0.6m\n\nEntrance Hall\n\nLivingroom 4.4m x 3.5m with solid fuel stove\n\nDiningroom 2.9m x 2.8m\n\nKitchen 3.5m x 2.1m with range of fitted units\n\nBedroom 1. 4.1m x 2.6m with fitted wardrobes \n\nBedroom 2. 3.7m x 3.1m with fitted wardrobes \n\nBedroom 3. 3.1m x 3m with fitted wardrobes\n\nBathroom 2.2m x 2m\n \nOUTSIDE: Off street parking, gardens front and rear, garden shed and rear access \nSERVICES: All main services and partial electric heating \nBER: F No 119845048\nEIRCODE: Y34R889\nVIEWING: By prior appointment\n\n"
